            "notes": "**[EN]**\nFrom the third round, you will start generating a lot of damage just with dash and it is very important to be finishing your opponents.\n\nHashimoto's Bane or Hanamura Healing are both very valid options to finish for sure or stay alive during the clash between tanks.\n\nIt is a valid option also Forged Under Fire or Sprit of Sojiro, to also recover a lot of hp with the deflect or always be with the dash through the Spirit of Sojiro.\n\n**[PT-BR]**\nA partir da terceira rodada, voc\u00ea come\u00e7ar\u00e1 a gerar muito dano apenas com o Dash e \u00e9 muito importante estar finalizando seus oponentes.\n\nAlgoz de Hashimoto ou Cura de Hanamura s\u00e3o op\u00e7\u00f5es muito v\u00e1lidas para finalizar com certeza ou permanecer vivo durante o confronto entre tanques.\n\n\u00c9 uma op\u00e7\u00e3o v\u00e1lida tamb\u00e9m Forjado A Fogo ou Esp\u00edrito de Sojiro, para tamb\u00e9m recuperar muito HP com o defletir ou estar sempre com o avan\u00e7o atrav\u00e9s do Esp\u00edrito de Sojiro.",
